Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:51:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 46/47] metal: GPU prediction FFT via copy-swap forward c2c

mx_predict_fft copies the ducc0-owned plane to the shared vkFFT buffer,
runs the proven forward transform (5.9e-07 at 3072), copies back.
Thread-local plans, MX_METAL_NO_PREDICT kill-switch, registered behind
-mgpu. 1024 multiscale gate with all three hooks: all T2 PASS.

